chunks.text:
Emitting is is the process of taking the original TypeScript files and outputting them as JavaScript (
`.js`
) and/or declaration files (
`.d.ts`
).
Here's an example:
```ts
const project = new Project({ compilerOptions: { outDir: "dist", declaration: true } });
project.createSourceFile("MyFile.ts", "const num = 1;");
project.emit(); // async

// or
project.emitSync(); // slow
```
This outputs two files in the
`dist`
folder:
```ts
// MyFile.js
var num = 1;

// MyFile.d.ts
declare const num = 1;
```

